From 5688a0398afab8992666a496d399fab9792880d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 21:49:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] device/phh/treble: ship RestlessStars wallpapers and picker
 options

Install the RestlessStars dark wallpapers (art by Ziednaga, CC BY-NC
4.0) to /system/etc/wallpaper and point the wallpaper service at them
via ro.config.wallpaper (homescreen) and ro.config.lock_wallpaper
(lock screen, enabled by the frameworks/base per-screen defaults
patch). if the prop files are missing the wallpaper service falls back
to the framework default_wallpaper resource.

Also ship WallpaperPicker2 and a partner customization apk exposing
the remaining RestlessStars V2 wallpapers as on-device options. the
picker discovers partner wallpapers via the launcher
PARTNER_CUSTOMIZATION broadcast; each entry pairs a full drawable with
a _small thumbnail. the two defaults surface separately through
DefaultWallpaperInfo.
